# Environment variable template — SAFE TO COMMIT.
#
# Copy to `.env.local` for local development. Never commit real values:
# `.env`, `.env.local` and `.env.*` are git-ignored (`.gitignore`).
#
# No environment variables are required yet — this project has no runtime
# integrations configured (no database, auth, AWS, Cloudflare, analytics or
# payment providers). Add keys here (name + short comment, no value) as
# modules introduce them, and record each in docs/privacy/DATA_INVENTORY.md
# and docs/security/THREAT_MODEL.md.

# Example (placeholder — not active):
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL="http://localhost:3000"
